The tile is created but NOT initialized (no fill()). Then data is loaded via loadTileRLE and assignImageBytes. But what if the layer dimensions or data doesn't cover all pixels? Or the RLE data is corrupted?

Actually, looking at this more carefully, when loadTileRLE succeeds, it writes exactly `image_size` pixels per channel (with image_size = width * height of the tile). So ALL pixel positions get written. The tile should be fully initialized.

